    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Макс, стой!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's walk through it. The guests arrive.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Здрасте.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.' Nastya greets Vika awkwardly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это твоя вечеринка?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is this your party?' Vika asks Max sarcastically.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Ты сказал, её не будет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You said she would not be here.' Nastya confronts Max about his lie.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Как может меня не быть дома?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How can I not be at home?' Vika points out the absurdity of the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Зачем ты их привёл?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you bring them?' She demands an explanation from Max.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Почему ты не предупредил нас?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you not warn us?' Nastya is angry about the ambush.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы бы никогда не пришли.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You would never have come.' Max defends his deceptive methods.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Вы мои друзья.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are my friends.' He reminds them of their bond.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я хотел отметить день рождения вместе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to celebrate the birthday together.' He just wanted a nice party.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Можете не волноваться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not have to worry.' He gives up on the idea.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо за прекрасный вечер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for a lovely evening.' He says this with heavy sarcasm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пока.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bye.' He turns to leave the apartment.",
